    "bounding box" : [ 54.0, 376.067, 299.084, 427.474 ],
    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "where the identity in the τ basis ensures it has both U(1) symmetries, K is a parameter, and m(k) is the same as in (3). This model is a magnetic Weyl semimetal model that has the two Weyl nodes at k = ±K where K = (0,0,K)."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 20,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 63.963, 371.328, 266.292, 381.291 ],
    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Let’s linearize around the Weyl nodes. We get"
  }, {
