    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 317.014, 152.725, 562.097, 204.132 ],
    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "This model has Weyl nodes at all eight time-reversalinvariant-momentum (TRIM) points of the Brillouin zone, as well as a time-reversal symmetry Θ = iσyK, where K is complex conjugation, satisfying Θ2 = −1."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
