    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 317.014, 113.621, 562.095, 157.955 ],
    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "We will now add a U(1) symmetry-breaking term that will gap out all Weyl nodes except the one at k = 0. In order to facilitate our discussion, let us first define a bump function B(k) given by"
  }, {
